mx-8"><a class="flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 text-white no-underline md:px-6 lg:px-8" href="/portal/coaching/session/a-oldest"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center" style="width: 26px; height: 26px;"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[rgba(239,83,80,0.55)] animate-attention-ring motion-reduce:hidden"></span><span class="relative rounded-full bg-[#ef5350]" style="width: 14.040000000000001px; height: 14.040000000000001px;"></span></span><span class="flex-1 text-[17px] font-bold">1 more lesson needs your answer</span><span class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-[10px] bg-white px-4 text-base font-bold text-primary">Next <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">›</span></span></a></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col gap-3.5 pb-6"><div class="mb-3 flex h-12 items-center gap-1"><button type="button" aria-label="Back to Coaching" class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left h-6 w-6"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">Coaching</span></div><div><h1 class="text-[24px] font-bold leading-tight" dir="auto">Provinces of Pakistan</h1><p class="text-[15px] text-[#5b6170]">Social Studies · 2 October · 28 min</p></div><p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-sm text-[#1b6b43]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Analysis done</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Question answered</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Report ready</span></p><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white p-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-bold text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-headphones h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 14h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3"></path></svg>Listen to your Digital Coach</h2><audio controls="" preload="none" src="https://r2/debrief.mp3" class="w-full"></audio></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border-2 border-accent bg-[#e3f4ea] p-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-bold text-[#1b6b43]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg>Try this next time</h2><p class="text-[17px] leading-snug" dir="auto">Ask a child to point on the map before you explain.</p></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white p-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-bold text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>What went well</h2><ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-1.5 pl-5 text-[16px] leading-snug"><li dir="auto">You used the map to start the lesson.</li></ul></section><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex h-14 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-white px-4 text-[17px] font-bold text-primary"><span>Your reflection</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-2xl font-normal">+</span></button><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex h-14 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-white px-4 text-[17px] font-bold text-primary"><span>See more</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-2xl font-normal">+</span></button><section data-testid="transcript" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white p-4"><h2 class="text-[17px] font-bold text-primary">What was said in class</h2><div data-testid="transcript-line" class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 font-semibold bg-primary text-white">Teacher</span><span class="text-[#9aa0aa]">00:10</span></span><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed" dir="auto">line 1</p></div><div data-testid="transcript-line" class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 font-semibold bg-[#e3f4ea] text-[#1b6b43]">Student</span><span class="text-[#9aa0aa]">00:11</span></span><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed" dir="auto">line 2</p></div></section></div></main></div>"`;

